Write your post here using Markdown.

## Add a section

Write paragraphs, add headings, or make lists:

- First idea
- Second idea

To add an image, put it in `public/images/blog/` and use:

![Describe the image](/portfolio/images/blog/your-image.jpg)

When the post is ready, change `draft: true` to `draft: false`.

For a Vietnamese version, create a sibling file named `<post-name>.vi.md`.
Copy the post's frontmatter, translate its title, description, and content, then
add these fields:

```yaml
language: "vi"
translationKey: "<post-name>"
```

Keep the English post's filename as `<post-name>.md`. The Vietnamese file is
paired with it and does not appear as a separate post.
